# Every change to the registry itself requires a review from a named owner
# before merge — this is the actual "PR-gated review" security control the
# whole project's threat model rests on (Outside Voice T2 from the CEO
# review: CI alone only checks schema shape, it doesn't replace a human).
#
# Honest limitation, not glossed over: on a solo/early-stage repo the named
# owner below may be the same person opening most PRs, which makes this a
# self-approval gate in practice, not independent review. That's a real gap
# in the security story until a second maintainer exists — see
# CONTRIBUTING.md's "Review model" section.
